Package: com.romeo.appversion
Name: AppVersion
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Discovery build. Logs how the App Store names the app version it is asking Apple for, so a downgrade hook can be written against what is actually there.
Maintainer: Romeo <romeogregoryx@gmail.com>
Author: Romeo <romeogregoryx@gmail.com>
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit, firmware (>= 15.0)
